    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929020/extras/47167892348a9273ebf1fe7e07781ea8.avif?t=1755183006\" data-has-big width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A TWISTED PLACE is a 2.5D Single-Player Horror game with multiple chapters that alternates between Side-view and 1st person gameplay for a scarier experience. Find your way through a nightmare unlike anything you've ever experienced before. In this unconventional horror game you'll have to survive as best as you can while being surrounded by horrors beyond human comprehension. Interact with the environment to solve puzzles and to find tools, information and secrets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929020/extras/f2523dfdf2cbd5ce8872ddf3974883c4.avif?t=1755183006\" width=800 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're constantly hunted by cursed entities that lurk in the darkness. Your only option is to run and hide before you get caught, whether it\u2019s hiding under a bed, slipping into a closet, or crouching behind debris, the environment becomes your lifeline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929020/extras/79a7e66951ce03ed412fc561832c9597.poster.avif?t=1755183006\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929020/extras/79a7e66951ce03ed412fc561832c9597.webm?t=1755183006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929020/extras/79a7e66951ce03ed412fc561832c9597.mp4?t=1755183006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929020/extras/99976268cdfb6085b42113f31653c6b7.webp?t=1755183006\" data-has-big width=800 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929020/extras/a490eddb342e3e1e3196740ccc5c463d.avif?t=1755183006\" width=800 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll need to explore and interact with your surroundings to find tools and gather information needed to progress. Every room, drawer, and hidden corner could hold something important. Along the way you can also discover secrets and collectibles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929020/extras/450d0bc0f07a03ca368998c1c33e0903.poster.avif?t=1755183006\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929020/extras/450d0bc0f07a03ca368998c1c33e0903.webm?t=1755183006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929020/extras/450d0bc0f07a03ca368998c1c33e0903.mp4?t=1755183006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929020/extras/99976268cdfb6085b42113f31653c6b7.webp?t=1755183006\" data-has-big width=800 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929020/extras/cbce556465d68bbdee1f65423c6ec926.avif?t=1755183006\" width=800 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ultimate goal is to escape from the place that traps you. The horrors you encounter are relentless, and the only way to survive is to find a way out. <br>Can you make it out alive? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929020/extras/a91a21bea6a187f629938d15a96cdd30.poster.avif?t=1755183006\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929020/extras/a91a21bea6a187f629938d15a96cdd30.webm?t=1755183006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929020/extras/a91a21bea6a187f629938d15a96cdd30.mp4?t=1755183006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929020/extras/99976268cdfb6085b42113f31653c6b7.webp?t=1755183006\" data-has-big width=800 height=31 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929020/extras/1dc23dcbcce7252b9b1088bd359c50e9.webp?t=1755183006\" width=140 height=58 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric Horror that alternates sideview and 1st person gameplay;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-Player;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 hours of gameplay; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique &amp; Unconventional graphics with scary and eerie content; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple chapters &amp; hidden collectibles;  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive environment; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Disclaimer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains disturbing content.<br>Play it at your own risk.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929020/extras/47167892348a9273ebf1fe7e07781ea8.avif?t=1755183006\" data-has-big width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A TWISTED PLACE is a 2.5D Single-Player Horror game with multiple chapters that alternates between Side-view and 1st person gameplay for a scarier experience. Find your way through a nightmare unlike anything you've ever experienced before. In this unconventional horror game you'll have to survive as best as you can while being surrounded by horrors beyond human comprehension. Interact with the environment to solve puzzles and to find tools, information and secrets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929020/extras/f2523dfdf2cbd5ce8872ddf3974883c4.avif?t=1755183006\" width=800 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're constantly hunted by cursed entities that lurk in the darkness. Your only option is to run and hide before you get caught, whether it\u2019s hiding under a bed, slipping into a closet, or crouching behind debris, the environment becomes your lifeline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929020/extras/79a7e66951ce03ed412fc561832c9597.poster.avif?t=1755183006\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929020/extras/79a7e66951ce03ed412fc561832c9597.webm?t=1755183006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\