re_item_assets/steam/apps/2929020/extras/cbce556465d68bbdee1f65423c6ec926.avif?t=1755183006\" width=800 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ultimate goal is to escape from the place that traps you. The horrors you encounter are relentless, and the only way to survive is to find a way out. <br>Can you make it out alive? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929020/extras/a91a21bea6a187f629938d15a96cdd30.poster.avif?t=1755183006\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929020/extras/a91a21bea6a187f629938d15a96cdd30.webm?t=1755183006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929020/extras/a91a21bea6a187f629938d15a96cdd30.mp4?t=1755183006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929020/extras/99976268cdfb6085b42113f31653c6b7.webp?t=1755183006\" data-has-big width=800 height=31 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929020/extras/1dc23dcbcce7252b9b1088bd359c50e9.webp?t=1755183006\" width=140 height=58 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric Horror that alternates sideview and 1st person gameplay;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-Player;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 hours of gameplay; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique &amp; Unconventional graphics with scary and eerie content; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple chapters &amp; hidden collectibles;  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive environment; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 